# Clarionview (dc_workbench) — LLM Wiki (Karpathy pattern)

This repo follows Andrej Karpathy’s **LLM Wiki** idea ([gist](https://gist.github.com/karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f)): **raw sources → compiled markdown → agent guidance** (skills/rules) so work stays consistent and attributable.

## Where things live (this repo)

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| **Raw source** (immutable gist copy) | `docs/llm-wiki-raw/karpathy-llm-wiki-gist.md` |
| **Compiled / narrative docs** | `CLAUDE.md`, `DEPLOY.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, and code-adjacent READMEs as they exist |
| **Cursor rules** | `.cursor/rules/` (e.g. `workbench-scope.mdc`, this file) |

There is **no** separate Obsidian vault in this tree; if you add one later, wire it the way the gist describes and update this table.

## Conventions

1. **Don’t edit** `docs/llm-wiki-raw/karpathy-llm-wiki-gist.md` except to refresh from upstream gist intentionally.
2. **Do** update compiled docs when behavior or deployment changes; keep them the source of truth for *this* app.
3. Respect **`.cursor/rules/workbench-scope.mdc`**: changes stay inside this workspace unless the user names another path.
